WEBVTT

01:02:29.019 --> 01:02:30.843
if there was one they could focus on?

01:02:31.307 --> 01:02:34.950
KFL: I want people to think
about 30 years from now.

01:02:35.363 --> 01:02:39.045
When all this is said and done
and things settle,

01:02:39.069 --> 01:02:44.061
AI will have contributed
a lot of things to us as humanity.

01:02:44.085 --> 01:02:47.974
AI will contribute
a huge amount of economic value

01:02:47.998 --> 01:02:51.131
by being able to do
routine work more cheaply.

01:02:51.442 --> 01:02:55.320
That could be used
to reduce poverty and hunger.

01:02:55.344 --> 01:02:58.788
AI will liberate us from routine jobs.

01:02:58.812 --> 01:03:02.653
So ultimately, when all
the transitions are done,